cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: yippy
abstract: "yippy is an open-source Python library for reading, interpreting, and querying coronagraph performance data from Yield Input Packages (YIPs). It provides Fourier-domain PSF interpolation, AYO/EXOSIMS-compatible exports, and a JAX-compatible interface for use in differentiable and GPU-accelerated Habitable Worlds Observatory simulation pipelines."
authors:
